            <div xml:id="m-7ef6e39c-c400-41af-9a6b-b5470202f9bb">
              <lg xml:id="m-8e969188-855a-4dfe-87eb-3c64702c276f">
                <l xml:id="m-8732b6d9-3105-4327-8bcf-c6451f1e98df" facs="#m-bf53b871-488d-4aae-b085-8baaa8c8d1a8" label="text-like">Common of a Virgin Martyr. Mass I.</l><l xml:id="m-f6ad4b25-593f-404a-8ab1-2a26a51ca638" facs="#m-430f4982-852b-484e-834d-65bf3ff9ca27" label="ambiguous">1210</l><l xml:id="m-b1e42fbe-96a5-403e-b0b4-269a42a44d7a" facs="#m-d7e5e906-1b3e-4085-a0f8-66c159f8af7b" label="lyrics-like">ci-e tú¬</l><l xml:id="m-338888ca-f933-482f-97cd-3c82e2b5af51" facs="#m-624090dc-3e09-4ade-96f5-c54e5c7f974d" label="lyrics-like">et pulchri-tú-dine tú¬</l><l xml:id="m-0cba8953-7081-4c1e-9b29-d1f24e0080ae" facs="#m-2248d6f2-6c73-4f07-ac96-da8154a93641" label="ambiguous">a,</l><l xml:id="m-4d8947b9-3881-4229-822f-b5e4287f5d9d" facs="#m-5975946f-0a5e-479f-94c7-81bf14b424b8" label="lyrics-like">inténde, pró¬</l><l xml:id="m-0312035b-3d92-41fc-9033-89fc39d1ad76" facs="#m-8e209151-963b-4471-b0fb-8a44d1e0c28e" label="lyrics-like">spe-re pro-céde, * et ré¬ gna.</l><l xml:id="m-81e654e0-88d0-48b3-a901-969ba229afe4" facs="#m-55f660d8-c398-41e0-a523-1a6d8fdad158" label="ambiguous">† Sequentia sancti Evangelii secundum Matthaeum. Matth. 25</l><l xml:id="m-45afca95-baa6-4327-abb0-de2f1f00888e" facs="#m-3ff72988-6abf-44d1-8847-e311a0ac1c0c" label="lyrics-like">TN illo témpore: Dixit Jesus disci-(pades suas. Fátuae autem sapién¬</l><l xml:id="m-6c38f9b8-d3ef-435c-8de1-fb696f664f44" facs="#m-8de5029a-2b36-4b54-8e20-c03a1b1e2817" label="lyrics-like">tibus dixérunt : Date nobis de óleo</l><l xml:id="m-ffb7f6c8-1a50-4951-9c4c-547d9ea6759d" facs="#m-95b36605-491a-4225-94dd-d00e3259a992" label="lyrics-like">L pulis suis parábolam hanc: Si¬</l><l xml:id="m-3ab4e0d2-b1cc-456b-9e96-635faa668cbe" facs="#m-e6d2724d-7f28-4be6-9d5e-c4b2ea030c6c" label="lyrics-like">vestro, quia lámpades nostrae ex¬</l><l xml:id="m-e4d8330d-64e5-41f4-b745-0ec25da9ae58" facs="#m-60192de7-7dcd-461f-bbb1-e5721c309788" label="lyrics-like">mile erit regnum caelórum decem</l><l xml:id="m-19d2503a-852d-4872-8daf-7fc142e0d509" facs="#m-0f70a311-a9fd-40a8-a513-dcb6ed947931" label="lyrics-like">virgínibus: quae accipiéntes lám¬</l><l xml:id="m-e4342551-7545-4f73-878f-c16dae19b011" facs="#m-fa9600b3-2393-42cb-aa4c-7d0acbe5f98c" label="lyrics-like">stinguúntur. Respondérunt prudén¬</l><l xml:id="m-24988c7a-53a7-459a-bd6a-042f45e96658" facs="#m-147b9dc6-d695-492c-b0ef-0d364ab7c9ed" label="lyrics-like">tes, dicéntes: Ne forte non sufficiat</l><l xml:id="m-f6f95e91-acf1-44b1-8ebf-cdbd20fd6699" facs="#m-72aec858-4ebe-426c-abe1-4e62be1bfdd6" label="lyrics-like">pades suas, exiérunt óbviam sponso</l><l xml:id="m-0c27d05d-5054-4370-a265-a0feafdbd627" facs="#m-3ad67987-fd44-4ae6-a0bf-fd7d10e0f54f" label="lyrics-like">nobis et vobis, ite pótius ad ven¬</l><l xml:id="m-108a6028-1bd0-46c1-a1e8-174e7e2a5f80" facs="#m-e923c2a8-5f2e-4f0d-86e6-bd4580a9a2ac" label="ambiguous">et sponsae. Quinque autem ex eis</l><l xml:id="m-7000113d-0835-44b1-97c0-b8bff4fb5b4c" facs="#m-0a0109a7-7294-401f-b709-6296c5673e96" label="lyrics-like">déntes, et émite vobis. Dum autem</l><l xml:id="m-977a78e0-6974-4eea-b3b8-c66a7c357231" facs="#m-60105691-b056-4e77-8bf4-974b7d0713ff" label="lyrics-like">erant fátuae, et quinque prudéntes:</l><l xml:id="m-2b9c4f00-4219-4f1e-b9f9-2613f0f9a88e" facs="#m-af06b019-5a6c-4875-ba9a-5e3bea67b8b2" label="lyrics-like">sed quinque fátüae, accéptis lam¬</l><l xml:id="m-88ac1f5a-d0fd-4cbe-a4f7-82041be964fc" facs="#m-3f031e3d-eaa4-46b1-9e03-e3980e77a0d2" label="lyrics-like">irent émere, venit sponsus : et quae</l><l xml:id="m-ea68bb39-dd97-402d-acdb-9774b610fd8f" facs="#m-911c3927-4818-4119-adae-cf3a9e524dc7" label="lyrics-like">pádibus, non sumpsérunt óleum</l><l xml:id="m-b5f11cff-4fcc-476b-b18c-e9dd2ae94300" facs="#m-f150fdbe-6098-44c1-bd33-79f35dff1c84" label="lyrics-like">parátae erant, intravérunt cum eo</l><l xml:id="m-99d4929c-9258-4c1b-9386-30456a83aabd" facs="#m-4678e4b3-53a0-4ca3-9518-26f662693a04" label="lyrics-like">ad núptias, et clausa est jánua. No¬</l><l xml:id="m-165940dd-71cf-4f13-9477-9be89074ae0c" facs="#m-08fb5d3b-7399-4708-8d5e-ba711de642be" label="lyrics-like">secum : prudéntes vero accepérunt</l><l xml:id="m-59058640-7a76-4a72-8d89-702457a4f1fe" facs="#m-5d2af994-a12d-4e4d-b248-5ae62a824b91" label="lyrics-like">víssime vero véniunt et réliquae</l><l xml:id="m-a1857707-b6af-4a20-89db-f6792d31f47b" facs="#m-7514827a-abaf-4269-ba3c-b6fca59f6adb" label="lyrics-like">óleum in vasis suis cum lampádibus.</l><l xml:id="m-d7f19b26-5fc9-4484-8383-8efbbaa2d121" facs="#m-0dfaf984-ac96-4985-8019-a13c869bdf08" label="lyrics-like">vírgines, dicéntes: Dómine, Dòmi¬</l><l xml:id="m-17f32f60-c664-4e32-b4a8-19be357b9808" facs="#m-44bc2be7-8a83-4f58-8f57-fc16890add08" label="lyrics-like">Moram autem faciénte sponso, dor¬</l><l xml:id="m-fe88d4e1-be8f-45df-94d8-26ed81c7d201" facs="#m-dd271b54-bd54-4e5a-b2aa-ca618f7e476b" label="lyrics-like">ne, áperi nobis. At ille respóndens,</l><l xml:id="m-aabd17c7-c86c-447a-97cc-e1addd5c1bfe" facs="#m-a3defe1b-8b1f-423b-9810-e5dfcb42be0a" label="lyrics-like">mitavérunt omnes et dormiérunt.</l><l xml:id="m-3898436a-8962-48ce-8cf1-15c4021eb52e" facs="#m-73d6f303-c4c6-453a-8151-9ee10b0c614f" label="lyrics-like">ait: Amen dico vobis, néscio vos¬</l><l xml:id="m-933c5e23-e34e-4cad-99f6-a2e8d958125d" facs="#m-80b396cb-c333-4d82-881a-f075bafa1e9a" label="lyrics-like">Média autem nocte clamor factus</l><l xml:id="m-a59da672-b4d7-4c12-9d04-a070e6a2f054" facs="#m-ed989151-567c-44c3-b14f-2b4f78406b27" label="lyrics-like">Vigiláte staque quia nescitis diem</l><l xml:id="m-a8cef1cd-a002-42d4-bac9-4ef76cabd994" facs="#m-b3da2f0d-9608-44a0-8303-5483f63c415e" label="lyrics-like">est : Ecce sponsus venit, exite ób¬</l><l xml:id="m-b8dfd1d8-0278-40d4-813c-845aedf30cee" facs="#m-b9f1e305-7c9f-4286-9695-a62dd3e9a68f" label="ambiguous">neque horam.</l><l xml:id="m-644f2d34-b98b-432b-bef7-6040d2852624" facs="#m-513e5172-a8ec-45d6-834c-6959fd49327c" label="lyrics-like">viam ei. Tunc surrexérunt omnes</l><l xml:id="m-3e7896be-a178-4236-b1d2-abb185f0488e" facs="#m-71df8d93-5caf-490b-a481-b2bbb00b6e64" label="lyrics-like">virgines illae, et ornavérunt lám¬</l><l xml:id="m-72994248-67fa-4cf7-b8c4-0e20b8e69a79" facs="#m-2681ed36-9f0b-4249-8874-bd06b2bddf98" label="ambiguous">omert.E</l><l xml:id="m-fd7aec9b-2f1b-4467-bd74-a3a2f09378e0" facs="#m-1dc39293-0c25-41fd-85ab-5e2a9bdbee76" label="ambiguous">4.</l><l xml:id="m-8c3f74a6-6e56-4def-bf22-9b188f59e4a1" facs="#m-3461fa3e-5a8c-48a5-abb7-0b7ea45e218c" label="lyrics-like">AF-fe-réntur" ré-gi vírgi-nes:</l><l xml:id="m-69823fd9-5505-4541-a374-adea5edd9ad2" facs="#m-dde2f4ae-eaa5-4696-b03e-f6fb790b1aeb" label="lyrics-like">pró-ximae</l><l xml:id="m-e520c44d-acc8-4485-930f-a6e42cedfc9c" facs="#m-3064cbd9-254d-4d1c-951e-9ec4f50cdaef" label="lyrics-like">in laetí-ti-a</l><l xml:id="m-97fb88f1-b83b-4ebe-b0f4-6432e6fd3dfc" facs="#m-ecce6330-ff5e-400a-9c3f-1ecd1bf09dec" label="lyrics-like">affe-rén-tur  bi</l><l xml:id="m-ea1ff590-138f-4812-852b-3a0f5126d06d" facs="#m-fb4dcba3-1b00-4f5c-8102-75c343c6cc7c" label="lyrics-like">é-jus</l><l xml:id="m-3f50abaf-b38d-483a-8824-53559a5d7183" facs="#m-897c4705-a895-4a7a-ad98-a6ceb5f424ab" label="lyrics-like">in tém¬</l><l xml:id="m-72de5098-a3e9-4d6b-b5c3-61c57f65d292" facs="#m-eb377a88-bee4-4324-8be5-d89e606e2788" label="lyrics-like">addu-cén-tur</l><l xml:id="m-ef085e82-6586-4b82-8abe-dcb6010d30f3" facs="#m-48d9eb71-8975-4f95-99b3-bf0d40edf20a" label="ambiguous">et exsulta¬ ti- 6-ne:</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
